}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
17. What would be needed to justify \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]information arises \
as energy\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]?\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"fe5781d5-48e2-b447-a3b4-eeef284da722"],

Cell["\<\
A rigorous notebook should distinguish several possible meanings: \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"203468da-0da3-304f-8905-99eaefba1d68"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Level A: symbolic analogy", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"13782fd5-8bcd-fb4f-bf0a-c281a69823a0"],

Cell["\<\
A term in the action resembles an information-theoretic functional. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"384e1baf-5ae5-f145-937f-7758f22e8624"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Level B: variational conjugacy", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"1473035a-aa72-3743-862a-92b9216c1552"],

Cell["\<\
An information functional appears as part of an energy functional whose \
extrema govern dynamics. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f99b66f8-e325-7140-858c-97b420e591bd"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Level C: thermodynamic correspondence", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"adec3f7b-42db-1f42-9b10-fdadffaaa577"],

Cell["\<\
There is a derivable relation to free energy, entropy production, or \
Landauer-type cost. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"093d0a23-e83d-0c46-a44c-94aac1718f16"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Level D: measurable physics", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"df0154e6-edfb-d94b-9710-70d13367db60"],

Cell["A laboratory observable can be predicted and falsified.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"79a92d40-7169-6843-bf35-c7b2e4aea147"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "At present, the material most strongly supports ",
 StyleBox["Level A/B",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ", not automatically C/D. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7aafe50e-97ca-8f42-8058-564c5316dec2"],

