  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"6c6ec4f8-edbb-dc47-add0-73caad6f3fba"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["23. Bottom line", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"9154d194-87c4-5842-bcc1-050f509a6c70"],

Cell["Yes \[LongDash] there is something worth formalizing here.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"58566beb-b24c-c147-b42b-7ccaf37aa7e3"],

Cell["But the rigorous path is: ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a9eab9c8-3075-2148-9bc9-2377a2d22f50"],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["correct the implementation first",
 FontWeight->Bold]], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"107ea0ba-69e7-b84e-87b7-\
a09908771f32"],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["separate model from interpretation",
 FontWeight->Bold]], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"3ea2b0af-3f8f-4f41-8561-\
8a185364aedb"],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["turn every important claim into an executable test",
 FontWeight->Bold]], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"a5576afd-e71d-c845-aa43-\
bb69c625558a"],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["treat \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]information\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]measurement\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], and \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]energy\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] as distinct until a derivation explicitly connects \
them",
 FontWeight->Bold]], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"7653d2ec-63a9-8b40-8420-\
ae985fd5c95e"],

Cell["\<\
That gives you a notebook that is useful, auditable, and much less likely to \
generate regret later.\
